{% comment %}
  SECTION: Ingredient Transparency
  Add to Shopify: Online Store → Themes → Edit code → Sections → New section → paste this
  Then add to your homepage template via the theme editor.

  REWRITTEN 2026-08-27 — the previous version of this file stated doses that do
  NOT match the Illuminate Labs certified panel (signed 2026-07-29): Ginkgo was
  listed at 120mg (certified: 207mg), Pea Protein at "5,000mg" (not on the
  certified panel — do not state a protein gram figure), and it included
  L-Theanine and L-Carnitine, neither of which is on the certified ingredient
  list. Every number below is the certified figure, per 10g serving. Ground
  truth: 07-Project_info/certifications/README_Illuminate_Labs_Certification.md
  Do not edit a dose here without checking that file first.

  CORRECTED AGAIN 2026-08-27 — per Illuminate Labs' own correction: they
  reviewed our declared formula against published research; they did not lab-
  test a physical sample to measure these amounts. Never phrase this as
  Illuminate Labs having produced/verified the numbers — the numbers are ours,
  reviewed by them. See the same note in Section-Certification.liquid.
{% endcomment %}

<section class="pc-ingredients" id="ingredients">
  <div class="pc-ingredients__inner">

    <div class="pc-ingredients__header">
      <span class="pc-ingredients__eyebrow">What's inside</span>
      <h2 class="pc-ingredients__title">Every ingredient. Every dose.<br>Nothing hidden.</h2>
      <p class="pc-ingredients__subtitle">
        Most functional coffee brands don't show you the numbers. We do —
        and every dose below was independently reviewed by Illuminate Labs
        against published safety and efficacy research, not just our own
        copywriting.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="pc-ingredients__grid">

      <!-- 1. Natural Caffeine (from soluble coffee + matcha) -->
      <div class="pc-ingredient">
        <div class="pc-ingredient__top">
          <span class="pc-ingredient__icon">☕</span>
          <div>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__name">Natural Caffeine</span>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__dose">~175mg per serving</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="pc-ingredient__mechanism">
          From soluble coffee and matcha combined. 175mg sits comfortably under
          the European Food Safety Authority's single-dose safety threshold of
          200mg — a normal amount, reviewed against the safety research, not a
          mega-dose stacked to make you feel something fast.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. Taurine -->
      <div class="pc-ingredient">
        <div class="pc-ingredient__top">
          <span class="pc-ingredient__icon">⚡</span>
          <div>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__name">Taurine</span>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__dose">2.1g per serving</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="pc-ingredient__mechanism">
          Endurance research shows taurine improves performance at single doses
          of 1–6g. Our 2.1g sits inside that range. This is the piece that's
          supposed to keep the caffeine from being the whole story — steady
          instead of spiked.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. Ginkgo Biloba Extract -->
      <div class="pc-ingredient">
        <div class="pc-ingredient__top">
          <span class="pc-ingredient__icon">🌿</span>
          <div>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__name">Ginkgo Biloba Extract</span>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__dose">207mg per serving</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="pc-ingredient__mechanism">
          A standardized extract, not a trace amount for the ingredient list.
          Ginkgo is in the formula for what it does over the length of a
          working day, not just the first ten minutes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. Thermogenic Spices (cinnamon, ginger, black pepper) -->
      <div class="pc-ingredient">
        <div class="pc-ingredient__top">
          <span class="pc-ingredient__icon">🌶️</span>
          <div>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__name">Thermogenic Spices</span>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__dose">~1.8g per serving</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="pc-ingredient__mechanism">
          Cinnamon, ginger, and black pepper extract. Not there for heat —
          there for how the body processes everything else in the scoop.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div><!-- /.pc-ingredients__grid -->

    <div class="pc-ingredients__also">
      <p class="pc-ingredients__also-label">Also in the formula</p>
      <p class="pc-ingredients__also-body">
        Pea protein (first on the ingredient list — no specific gram amount is
        on the certified panel yet, so we don't state one), plus gum arabic,
        xanthan gum, and sodium bicarbonate for texture, mixability, and
        stability.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="pc-ingredients__footer">
      <div class="pc-ingredients__total">
        <span class="pc-ingredients__total-label">Total per serving:</span>
        <span class="pc-ingredients__total-value">10g · 11 ingredients · 0 fillers</span>
      </div>
      <p class="pc-ingredients__disclaimer">
        These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration.
        This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div><!-- /.pc-ingredients__inner -->
</section>

<style>
.pc-ingredients {
  background: #171412;
  color: #F7F0E0;
  padding: 80px 24px;
  font-family: -apple-system, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
}

.pc-ingredients__inner {
  max-width: 1080px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.pc-ingredients__header {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 64px;
}

.pc-ingredients__eyebrow {
  display: inline-block;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.15em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #D9A633;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.pc-ingredients__title {
  font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 46px);
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1.15;
  color: #F7F0E0;
  margin: 0 0 20px;
}

.pc-ingredients__subtitle {
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: rgba(247,240,224,0.65);
  max-width: 580px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.pc-ingredients__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
  gap: 2px;
  background: rgba(247,240,224,0.06);
  border: 1px solid rgba(247,240,224,0.08);
  border-radius: 12px;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.pc-ingredient {
  padding: 28px 24px;
  background: #1E1A17;
  transition: background 0.2s;
}

.pc-ingredient:hover {
  background: #252019;
}

.pc-ingredient__top {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}

.pc-ingredient__icon {
  font-size: 26px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  margin-top: 2px;
}

.pc-ingredient__name {
  display: block;
  font-size: 17px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #F7F0E0;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}

.pc-ingredient__dose {
  display: block;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #D9A633;
  letter-spacing: 0.03em;
}

.pc-ingredient__mechanism {
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  color: rgba(247,240,224,0.7);
  margin: 0;
}

.pc-ingredients__also {
  margin-top: 32px;
  padding: 24px 28px;
  background: rgba(247,240,224,0.04);
  border: 1px solid rgba(247,240,224,0.08);
  border-radius: 10px;
}

.pc-ingredients__also-label {
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #D9A633;
  margin: 0 0 8px;
}

.pc-ingredients__also-body {
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  color: rgba(247,240,224,0.65);
  margin: 0;
}

.pc-ingredients__footer {
  margin-top: 48px;
  text-align: center;
}

.pc-ingredients__total {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  background: rgba(217,166,51,0.1);
  border: 1px solid rgba(217,166,51,0.25);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 12px 24px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.pc-ingredients__total-label {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: rgba(247,240,224,0.5);
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
}

.pc-ingredients__total-value {
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #D9A633;
}

.pc-ingredients__disclaimer {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: rgba(247,240,224,0.3);
  line-height: 1.6;
  max-width: 600px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .pc-ingredients {
    padding: 60px 16px;
  }
  .pc-ingredients__grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
</style>

